Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "I sense Cia's presence... But the one
who is over there is not the real Cia!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "It's the spirit of the one trapped in the
dark land. If it leaves, we may save Cia.",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Cia used to be our enemy...but we need
to save her. Let's trust Lana!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "They're calling support from inside the
keep. We can't just ignore that.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Cowards! They stay protected inside and
call reinforcements from there.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Then let's hurry and rescue Cia from
there before the enemies increase.",
  "1.0.6.0" => "They're raising reinforcements again...?
I have a bad feeling about this.",
  "1.0.7.0" => "We need to rescue Cia before the enemy
forces grow. If we do that, we'll be fine.",
  "1.0.8.0" => "We'll call our own reinforcements to
counter theirs!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Oh no! They're going after our
messengers!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Watch out! We only have one messenger
left!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "We couldn't protect them... Sorry...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "All right, at least one made it safely!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Then I'll call reinforcements! Get ready
for good news!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Hey! The one in black ran away!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "We need to leave them for now. For the
time being we need to find this Cia.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Let's work together and beat Phantom Ganon!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Lana, we need you! We can't save Cia
without you!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Lana, share your magic power with Cia.
Pull her spirit away from the darkness.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "All right... I'll try... Cia, I'll save
you this time for sure!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Hrm...? Where am I? Lana? You...
saved me...?",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Cia... We're finally together! Everyone,
lend a hand! I want to let her rest.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Then let us make this our home base
and protect it for a good while.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "The monsters are on the move. They
must be going after Lana, right?",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Cia still isn't in any condition to move.
I need to protect her!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Then I shall protect her too. Lana, I
leave it to you to instruct me.",
  "1.0.27.0" => "That presence... It's the fake Cia... Is
it trying to steal Cia's power?",
  "1.0.28.0" => "If we push back the monster hordes,
that impostor might show itself again.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Then we have to keep protecting Cia until
the one in black shows up again.",
  "1.0.30.0" => "We have to clear out all the fierce-
looking monsters.",
  "1.0.31.0" => "I guess we should also pay attention to
enemies making suspicious movements.",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Cia can't get away the way she is now...
We need to protect her!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Cia, someone's pretending to be you. Do
you know anything about that?",
  "1.0.34.0" => "You're speaking of Dark Cia... She stole
my power and tried to become me...",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Become you? Unthinkable! I'll put a stop
to that.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Monsters are closing in on Cia!
Everyone...please, protect her!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Thank you...Lana.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Enemies keep on coming! There's no end
to them unless we do something!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Their reinforcements have got to run out
sometime. If we take the keeps...",
  "1.0.40.0" => "The gates opened when we took the keep!
Open more gates to open up more paths!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Whew! That seems to stop reinforcements
from appearing at the keeps.",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Link?! You'll help protect me, too?",
  "1.0.43.0" => "You're not the enemy anymore. And you
need help.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Heh... Always the hero...",
  "1.0.45.0" => "What?! Enemy numbers are increasing
again!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "This can't be the last of them. Assume
we'll see more reinforcements ahead.",
  "1.0.47.0" => "They're trying to call in more enemies?
Well, isn't that nice of them!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "We have to do something to stop them
before more enemies show up!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "All right, that should keep our enemies
at bay.",
  "1.0.50.0" => "What? More of them?! Keep them away
from Cia!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "She controls so many monsters and still
has the power to come after Cia...",
  "1.0.52.0" => "We must stop our foe! If we don't,
enemy forces will be strengthened!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "What?! Well, don't just stand there!
Let's go!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Lana... If this continues...I'll...
disappear...",
  "1.0.55.0" => "D-don't disappear! Tell me what to do!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Defeat the one who stole my magic.
Return my power, and I'll be...",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Our enemies have become even stronger!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Yes! We stopped the enemy's scheme!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Again? Everyone's already so tired...",
  "1.0.60.0" => "One final effort. I can feel Dark Cia's
presence. She'll show herself soon.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Everyone! Please! Push for just a little
bit longer!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "They're trying to increase their numbers
again... I won't let them!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "If they get more reinforcements, we're
in trouble. We need to stop them!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Yes! No more reinforcements!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "We have defeated the bothersome fleas.
Now Dark Cia should appear. ",
  "1.0.66.0" => "I sense her presence drawing nearer.
Everyone, stay alert!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Er... That's...Dark Link? Why is there a
Dark Link too?",
  "1.0.68.0" => "They're going after Cia again!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Dark Cia will not stop hounding our Cia
until she can become her completely...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "We won't let her do that. Hold on, Cia...
We're going to take her down!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Dak Cia must have created the Dark
Links...",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Hrm... If we're to protect Cia, we must
destroy the Dark Links as well.",
  "1.0.73.0" => "We did it! Let's keep it up and take out
the next one!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Here she comes... Dark Cia.",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Don't worry, Cia. I'll defeat her. I
swear I will!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "That takes care of the Dark Links!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "We defeated Dark Cia. Now for the one
who stole my magic... Phantom Ganon!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Phantom Ganon? He's the evil one from
Tetra's world, right?",
  "1.0.79.0" => "He took your Triforce from you, Lana,
and he used me to sense your presence.",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Seeking power, he stole the Triforce and
Cia's magic, bringing chaos to the world.",
  "1.0.81.0" => "We know what we have to do. Let's
defeat this phantom and restore order!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Such incredible power! We can't let down
our guard!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "We'll be defeated like this... We must do
something!",
  "1.0.84.0" => "I'm...so sorry. It looks like I couldn't
help secure the future after all...",
  "1.0.85.0" => "We can't fight on like this any longer!
We can't save Cia!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "I can't do this anymore... I'm sorry,
Lana...",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Cia, no!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "The base is under attack! Get the enemy
away from there!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "The case is going down! Everyone defend
it! NOW!",
  "1.0.90.0" => "They took our base... It's over...",
  "1.0.91.0" => "I sense Cia's presence... I know she's
near!",
  "1.0.92.0" => "There she goes, acting before she thinks,
as usual... But I won't give up until the end.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "There are three Magic Keeps in both the east
and the west. They're empowering the enemy!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "I knew it! Capturing a Magic Keep severs its
connection to the rest of its group of keeps!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The west side has been taken care of. Now we
need to focus on the Magic Keeps in the east!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "The east side has been taken care of. Now we
need to focus on the Magic Keeps in the west!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Wow! Capturing that middle keep disconnected
all three Magic Keeps at once! Good idea!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "More Dark Links have appeared...?
Everyone, be careful!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "We'll be cornered if we stay here... All troops!
Fall back! On the double!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "The Sorceress's Chamber is somehow reviving
the Dark Links! We have to capture that keep!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Link! Know your limits!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Link should be all right now. Everyone!
Let's fall back!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Ugh... Such strength... We can't get away...",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Is...all hope lost...?",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Are we...too late...?",
  "13.0.15.0" => "Link...carry on... For me...",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Oh no! If Link falls, we don't stand a
chance against Cia and her forces!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "The burden...was too great...",
  "13.0.18.0" => "We can't let a single one of our friends fall
if we hope to stand a chance!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "The fight was...too much...",
  "13.0.20.0" => "I thought...I could do more...",
  "13.0.21.0" => "I should have...known my limits...",
  "13.0.22.0" => "I got careless...",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Oh! Half of those Dark Links have been beaten!
Shall we take care of the remaining two?",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Oh my... Would it be easier to flee through
the rose garden in the west?",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Ooh... Ouchie... This is it for me...",
  "13.0.26.0" => "Link...wait! I'm coming too!",
}